      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This was actually planned before launch. The death animation was supposed to remain dead until you moved or did another emote. It's just lower priority than tons of other things we're trying to get done at the moment. But it's on the list. Looping animations. Animations that play once and remain on last frame or last loop. etc.",
